{
  "name": "@engine/cms-core",
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "The Payload building blocks every CMS shares (PLAN-V2.md §3): access helpers and the role vocabulary, shared fields and hooks, the users/media/pages/redirects/leads/events/chat-sessions collection factories and the site-settings global factory, the database and migration tooling, the spreadsheet importer's engine, and the admin's shared shell (the page frame, the sidebar and home laid out by a CMS's own plan, the sidebar groups, the dashboard's SQL, periods and formats). Each CMS passes its own roles, admin groups, site-specific fields, config, plan and migrations; nothing here imports a CMS or an app.",
  "type": "module",
  "exports": {
    "./access": "./src/access/index.ts",
    "./fields": "./src/fields/index.ts",
    "./hooks": "./src/hooks/index.ts",
    "./i18n": "./src/i18n/index.ts",
